    "https://careers.miami.edu/us/en/home": {
      "title": "Explore Your Future",
      "description": "Careers at the University of Miami | University of Miami jobs Search results Explore Your Future BE PART OF THE UHEALTH DIFFERENCE IN SOLE MIA (City of North Miami ) Opening Fall 2025, UHealth SoLé Mia will bring high-quality academic medicine to the communities of North Miami, Aventura and the surrounding areas from our expert physicians and staff, including those from NCI-designated Sylvester Comprehensive Cancer Center and Bascom Palmer Eye Institute, the number-one eye hospital in the nation; urological treatments from the Desai Sethi Urology Institute; top-notch care from UHealth's nationally ranked neurology and neurosurgery programs and a wide range of specialty care. We're looking for exceptional candidates to join our team in! ​​​ View positions in SoLé Mia DELIVERING WORLD-CLASS HEALTH CARE IN DORAL Now Open! UHealth at Doral's impressive six-story, 160,000-square-foot, state-of-the-art facility offers a comprehensive range of specialty services. Our team includes expert physicians and staff from the NCI-designated Sylvester Comprehensive Cancer Center and the nationally acclaimed Bascom Palmer Eye Institute, ranked as the number one eye hospital in the country. Additionally, UHealth at Doral provides cutting-edge urologic treatments from the renowned Desai Sethi Urology Institute. ​​​ View positions in Doral SHINE WITH US HEALTH CARE CAREERS Learn more STAFF POSITIONS Learn more CURRENT EMPLOYEES Learn more FACULTY POSITIONS Learn more Explore The University of Miami is dedicated to the pursuit of positive change through the transformative power of people and ideas. With so many critical challenges on the horizon, we are embarking on an ambitious journey that we call Ever Brighter: The Campaign for Our Next Century. See more Watch the video Loading... ABOUT US Explore the stories behind the University of Miami and UHealth—the University of Miami Health System Meet Raveen Syan, M.D. Experts in academic medical research, innovate and shape the future of health care. Read more ​​​​​ Power innovation at the molecular level A building designed to fuel collaboration and highlight groundbreaking research. Read more Making waves Lisa Beal is renowned for her field studies on the Agulhas Current and its impact on climate change. Read more c06f2bcf3398444ea5c407ecf3cf1bc7"
    },
    "https://careers.miami.edu/us/en/discover-the-u": {
      "title": "Our Impact in Numbers",
      "description": "Discover the U | University of Miami Discover the U Join a vibrant community where innovation meets opportunity, and your growth fuels our success. Explore Careers Dynamic Work Environment Innovate, Collaborate, Thrive With cutting-edge facilities, collaborative spaces, and a commitment to innovation, UM offers an environment where creativity thrives. Whether you’re driving research breakthroughs, supporting student success, or advancing operational excellence, your contributions are at the forefront of progress. Canes Culture Driving Excellence and Wellbeing At the University of Miami, we are defined by excellence, opportunity, and success. Guided by fairness, respect, and civility, we create an environment where people thrive and achieve. Our faculty and staff ensure students and patients benefit from our dedication to education, research, innovation, and service. Recognition and Growth Be Celebrated for Your Impact, Grow Beyond Expectations We believe in celebrating our employees’ achievements and investing in their future. Through initiatives like employee spotlights, recognition awards, and comprehensive professional development programs, we are committed to your growth. Our Impact in Numbers A Legacy of Leadership For over a century, the University of Miami has been a pillar of innovation, education, and impact. Join an institution where tradition meets forward-thinking excellence. We are a global force for breakthrough research, educational excellence, and life-changing opportunities. Building Tomorrow’s Workforce With over 5,000 new hires annually, the University of Miami is constantly growing and evolving. Be part of a dynamic community that values top talent and innovative thinking. A Thriving Community Join a network of more than 19,000 dedicated professionals across 3 campuses and satellite locations. Together, we’re shaping the future through collaboration, innovation, and excellence. Your Journey Starts Here Ready to shape the future and be part of a world-class institution? At the University of Miami, your career is more than a job—it’s an opportunity to innovate, grow, and make a lasting impact. Together, we’re building the future. Discover Your Path Their Stories. Our Community. These featured voices represent the heart of what makes the U special—people who’ve given 25 years or more to building a better, bolder campus for us all. Janet Stearns, J.D. Faculty, School of Law 25 Years of Service Media player Scott Siegel Managing Philanthropy Officer 35 Years of Service Media player Anthea James Registered Nurse 2 - Specialty 38 Years of Service Media player Laurence Gardner, M.D. Professor of Medicine & Senior Advisor to the Dean 50 Years of Service Media player Benefits & Wellness at Your Fingertips See more Comprehensive Benefits Financial Wellness Professional Development Dynamic Workplace Find Where You Belong Experience the U Stay Connected Follow us and be part of the ‘Canes family! View this post on Instagram A post shared by University of Miami (@univmiami) ca1b4cbde6a44928a02ea9aeb329a4bc"
    },
    "https://careers.miami.edu/us/en/benefits-and-beyond": {
      "title": "Built Around What Matters Most",
      "description": "Benefits & Beyond | University of Miami Benefits & Beyond Explore the Benefits That Support Your Health, Growth, and Future Explore Careers Built Around What Matters Most In addition to your compensation, the University of Miami offers a Canes Total Rewards package, which includes health care coverage, time off, a voluntary retirement program with University-funded core and matching contributions, professional development opportunities, education benefits, and special discounts. Comprehensive Benefits Learn more Financial Wellness Learn more Professional Development Learn more Dynamic Workplace Learn more Comprehensive Benefits From your first day, we support your physical, mental, and emotional health and wellness. Plans and Programs Medical, dental & vision coverage Prescription drug coverage Flexible spending accounts Life, disability, and voluntary Insurance Wellness programs Time Off Paid time off Extended sick leave Long-term disability Family Medical Leave Act (FMLA) absences Personal leaves of absence Financial Wellness We care for your present and your future. Voluntary retirement plans University-funded 403(b) core contributions begin after one year of service if in an eligible job category Matching contributions begin after one year of service if in an eligible job category Employee discount program offers exclusive discounts for travel, dining, entertainment, and athletics Professional Development Grow personally and professionally with tuition support, skill-building, and career development. Tuition & Learning Support Tuition remission for undergraduate and graduate programs (excluding doctoral and online programs) Student loan repayment assistance Opportunities for upskilling and continuing education Available for eligible employees and dependent children Career Development Leadership and professional development programs Workshops and training focused on personal and professional growth Real-world skill building to thrive in your current role and beyond Dynamic Workplace We’re not just working — we’re building the future together. Join our mission to deliver innovative education, cutting-edge research, and exceptional patient care Opportunities to attend cultural and athletic events associated with the University of Miami Miami is where momentum meets opportunity—this is the place to be right now Looking for More? Explore Benefits & Wellness Portal 831340cb2ad847aa950a34a1de3fe168"
    },
    "https://careers.miami.edu/us/en/health-care-careers": {
      "title": "​​​​​​​Health Care Careers",
      "description": "Health Care Careers | UHealth: Where You Make A Difference ​​​​​​​Health Care Careers Helping You Find Your New Purpose UHealth: Where You Make A Difference UHealth - the University of Miami Health System delivers transformational patient care by the region’s most comprehensive team of doctors, powered by the groundbreaking research and medical education of the University of Miami Leonard M. Miller School of Medicine. As South Florida’s only academic-based health care system, UHealth combines a superior approach to patient care, with research, education, and academic excellence to create a personalized health care delivery system that is unparalleled. UHealth’s comprehensive network includes Sylvester Comprehensive Cancer Center, the only cancer center in South Florida designated by the National Cancer Institute (NCI); Bascom Palmer Eye Institute, the #1 ranked eye hospital in the country for the last 23 years*; a nationally ranked neurology and neurosurgery program for the fourth consecutive year*; a vast network of specialty services; and over a dozen outpatient facilities in Miami-Dade, Broward, Palm Beach, and Collier counties, with more than 1,800 physicians and scientists. Together with our affiliates, Jackson Memorial Hospital, Holtz Children’s Hospital, and the Miami VA, UHealth stands ready to provide life-saving care to our region and beyond. We are dedicated to continually developing an inclusive and rewarding culture for the full range of talent that comprise our ecosystem - including hiring pledges with Military.com, AARP and a growing list of partners. In recent years, the University of Miami Health System has received distinctions from Becker's Hospital Review,  Forbes, recognized as one of America’s Best In-State Employers (State of Florida), and as one of the Best Employers for Women. *Source: U.S. News & World Report Best Hospitals rankings Explore open positions and discover the benefits of being part of the UHealth team. The University of Miami Health System and the Miller School of Medicine offer: Competitive Salaries Competitive salaries within the region and local market Comprehensive benefit plan with coverage from start date Benefits Paid Time Off (PTO) and Extended Illness Bank (EIB) Comprehensive medical and dental insurance (several options available) Student loan repayment assistance program Work-Life Balance Access to state-of-the-art ​​​​​​​wellness center Flexible schedules Flexibility + Variety Full-Time, Part-Time, and ​​​​​​​Per Diem positions Close the popup Loading... Disable Audio Description Enable Audio Description Transcript Student Loan Repayment Assistance Program UHealth/MSOM will make monthly contributions directly towards your student loan debt, giving you more financial freedom. Learn More Wide Range of Disciplines Needed From nurses to lab technicians, receptionists to assistants, food service workers to pharmacy employees, the University of Miami Health System is the place for you and your career aspirations. As the only university health system in South Florida, we offer unique careers throughout our network of three hospitals and two dozen outpatient facilities located in Miami-Dade, Broward, Palm Beach, and Collier counties. To our communities 7d1de67a6e7c446f875f60f7dcafa5e7"
    },
